    "detailed_description": "The west coast has fallen. An army of undead roam the streets. Your only chance of survival is to retaliate. Not everyone will make it out alive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArcade LA Deadzone is a virtual reality cooperative fight through the streets of Los Angeles. Built specifically for VR Arcades, up to four players can share a space utilizing backpack PCs, becoming completely wireless. Optionally, the game can also be played where each player has their own section of the map if a backpack PC setup is not available. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing a quick setup technology, Arcade owners can input their own unique identifier code, so that players can jump right into the game without delay. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Full voice chat support<br />\r\n- Four players<br />\r\n- Spectator support (Inject an outside perspective using a non-VR computer so onlookers can enjoy seeing what's happening inside the game)<br />\r\n- Backpack PC and non-backpack PC setup<br />\r\n- Full Arcade Support<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease consult instructions for setup in the external links section of the store page, under user manual.",
